data_mmcif_ma-annotation.dic
# Proposed ModelCIF annotation module; release numbering is maintained upstream.
_pdbx_dictionary_component.datablock_id mmcif_ma-annotation.dic
_pdbx_dictionary_component.dictionary_component_id mmcif_ma-annotation.dic
_pdbx_dictionary_component.title 'ModelCIF compact annotation module'
_pdbx_dictionary_component.version 0.1.0
_pdbx_dictionary_component_history.dictionary_component_id mmcif_ma-annotation.dic
_pdbx_dictionary_component_history.version 0.1.0
_pdbx_dictionary_component_history.update 2026-11-11
_pdbx_dictionary_component_history.revision 'Proposed compact annotation module for working-group review.'

save_ma_annotation_definition
_category.description
;
Data items in the MA_ANNOTATION_DEFINITION category define scientific meaning, version, semantic level and value interpretation. Definitions may be shared terms or namespaced custom terms. A definition key and version must have one meaning throughout a data block.
;
_category.id ma_annotation_definition
_category.mandatory_code no
loop_
_category_key.name
'_ma_annotation_definition.id'
loop_
_category_group.id
inclusive_group
ma_group
_pdbx_category_context.type CONTRIBUTED
_pdbx_category_context.category_id ma_annotation_definition
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.id
_item_description.description
;
Unique row identifier within this category.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.id'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code int
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.definition_key
_item_description.description
;
Namespaced, stable identifier of the scientific definition.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.definition_key'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code line
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.version
_item_description.description
;
Version of the scientific definition, not the application version.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.version'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code code
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.name
_item_description.description
;
Human-readable annotation name.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.name'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code line
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.description
_item_description.description
;
Scientific interpretation, including operational definitions and value-domain meaning.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.description'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code text
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.reference
_item_description.description
;
Resolvable reference to the definition or method.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.reference'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code line
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.subject_level
_item_description.description
;
Semantic level of each subject. System is used only for zero-body annotations.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.subject_level'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
atom
residue
chain
molecule
token
system
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.body_order
_item_description.description
;
Number of subject operands, independently of value shape and group size.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.body_order'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code int
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
0
1
2
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.symmetric
_item_description.description
;
For two-body definitions, whether exchanging endpoints preserves meaning. Inapplicable otherwise.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.symmetric'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code boolean
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
YES
NO
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.value_kind
_item_description.description
;
Payload kind. Scalar and XYZ kinds have direct fields; array and group kinds reference their corresponding records.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.value_kind'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
boolean
integer
real
text
component
point3
vector3
array
group
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.units
_item_description.description
;
Units of values: none for dimensionless/non-numeric values and angstroms for points. Any other unit requires units_details, using existing dictionary unit codes where applicable.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.units'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code line
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.units_details
_item_description.description
;
Unambiguous definition and conversion convention for a unit not listed in the assembled dictionary.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.units_details'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code text
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.parameter_kind
_item_description.description
;
Optional selector on a value, separate from its subject and payload.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.parameter_kind'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
none
component
_item_default.value none
