save__ma_annotation_definition.omitted_state
_item_description.description
;
State of an omitted applicable value for a definition used in a set, unless a set-specific typed default applies. A wholly absent definition is not activated.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.omitted_state'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
unconstrained
unknown
not_applicable
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.array_element_kind
_item_description.description
;
Scalar type of array elements; required only for array values.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.array_element_kind'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
