component
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.array_rank
_item_description.description
;
Required positive rank for array values; inapplicable for other kinds.
;
_item.name '_ma_annotation_definition.array_rank'
_item.category_id ma_annotation_definition
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
save_

save__ma_annotation_definition.array_transform
_item_description.description
;
Array transformation. Point/vector arrays have a final Cartesian axis of length three; invariant arrays do not transform.
;
