save_ma_annotation_default
_category.description
;
Data items in MA_ANNOTATION_DEFAULT define set-specific uniform scalar defaults. This record activates a definition even if no explicit rows exist. Explicit rows override this default, including by a non-specified state. Defaults apply to all applicable subjects (or pairs) in set scope; geometry, arrays, component-parameterized, exact sequence identity and group defaults must be materialized as ordinary rows.
;
